{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>אל, פן</b> — two joined [words]." "<b>תתרע</b> — be evil." "<b>את</b> — like עם." "<b>לנפשך</b> — on account of your soul, that it be caught in a snare and die in its iniquity." "<b>משכבך</b> — when you lie upon it, if you have no other."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:15.548657504Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}